# ============================================================================
# OLIVE & EMBER BISTRO — SUPABASE CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# ============================================================================
# IMPORTANT:
# Because this project uses plain HTML, CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript without a
# bundler (like Vite or Webpack), the browser does NOT read .env files directly.
#
# Use the placeholders below as your reference values when configuring:
#   1. Local development: Create an untracked `js/config.local.js` file (ignored
#      by Git) or update the configuration constants in `js/supabase.js`.
#   2. Static hosting (Vercel): See README.md for step-by-step instructions.
#
# SECURITY WARNING:
# NEVER use your Supabase `service_role` / secret key in browser code!
# ONLY use your public Project URL and Publishable (`sb_publishable_...`) or
# legacy `anon` public key, combined with strict Row Level Security (RLS).
# ============================================================================

SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-supabase-publishable-or-anon-key-here
